     OUR STORY
     ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="split-section">
  <div class="split-section__content">
    <div class="section-label">Our Story</div>
    <h2>BUILT FOR THIS MARKET, BUILT FOR THE LONG TERM</h2>
    <p>Grosby Group was built on a single conviction: that Latin American publishers deserved direct access to the world's best photography, without the barriers, delays, and mark-ups that came with going through a global intermediary.</p>
    <p>We established relationships with the world's leading photo agencies and became their exclusive licensing representatives in Latin America and the US Hispanic market. We negotiated territory deals, built the infrastructure to deliver images on deadline, and earned a reputation for reliability that kept editors coming back, and kept agencies trusting us with their most valuable content.</p>
    <p>Thirty years later, that model is still what makes us different. We are not a platform. We are not a search engine. We are an agency, with relationships, expertise, and accountability on both sides of every deal.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="split-section__image">
    {% image images.hero.content, "Editorial photography — the archive of Latin American visual culture", "(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 40vw" %}
  </div>
</section>

