    <h2>THREE DECADES OF EDITORIAL EXPERTISE</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card fade-up">
        <h4>Content Syndication</h4>
        <p>We license photography from 40+ global partner agencies to 150+ publisher clients across Latin America and the US Hispanic market. Tens of millions of images across every editorial category.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card fade-up">
        <h4>Creator Representation</h4>
        <p>We represent individual photographers and smaller agencies, handling all licensing, contracts, and royalty collection for the Latin American market so they can focus on their work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card fade-up">
        <h4>Agency Distribution</h4>
        <p>For international photo agencies, we are the dedicated Latin American sub-agent, the partner with the relationships, the market knowledge, and the infrastructure to maximize revenue in this territory.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card fade-up">
        <h4>Production Services</h4>
        <p>We produce original photo and video content for brands and media companies across the region, from concept and casting to delivery. Editorial quality, commercial brief.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card fade-up">
        <h4>The Archive</h4>
        <p>Thirty years of Latin American visual culture, available exclusively through Grosby Group. Events, people, and moments that can't be found anywhere else, a resource without parallel in the region.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card fade-up">
        <h4>Editorial Consultation</h4>
        <p>Our team offers consultation for publishers building visual content strategies for Latin American and US Hispanic audiences. We know what resonates, and what doesn't.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

